VBRS project repo
be-tarask

The word dataset primarily includes:
Words from various dialects
Archaic words
Neologisms coined by various authors

All gathered from Bielaruska-rasiejski slounik (Bajkou-Niekrasevic) + Slounik bielaruskaj havorki (I.Nasovic) + other words from other sources defined in krynicy the dictionary itself

Orthographic conventions:
For the sake of consistency, both palatalized and non-palatalized forms of L are provided for words in which be-tarask uses a palatalized L, but Soviet orthography does not. This convention is applied even when both orthographies use a palatalized L.

Other minor normalizations:
`-sck-` is treated as `-sk-`.
`tč` is treated as `č` in almost all cases.


vbrs.txt ->
preface.txt
json/articles/{sayings.json, [а-я].json}
json/sources/preface.json
json/abbreviations.json

vbrs.krynicy.txt -> 
json/sources/krynicy.json
